	"data": "ADHD & Cithoreal: A Personal Deep Dive\n\n\"I'm not low energy today, but I am having a really hard time focusing on what I need to get done. It kind of feels more like an actual ADD rather than just being low energy or low motivation. I have motivation and energy. I just...\"\n— cithoreal, Oct 25, 2025 (vault/journals/2025/10-25-add.md)\n\n\"I've been finding myself... I wouldn't call it procrastinating but it's definitely like an ADD brain type... okay I want to do this thing and then I sit there…",
